<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Macro Search Spaces</h2>

<section id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">MobileNet Search Space.</h5>

<div id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The MobileNet search space employs MBConv blocks as fundamental units, featuring depthwise separable convolutions and squeeze-excitation modules. Configurable dimensions include:</p>
<ul id="A2.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A2.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Resolution</span> (<math id="A2.I1.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r\in\{160,176,192,208,224\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mn>160,176,192,208,224</mn><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r\in\{160,176,192,208,224\}</annotation></semantics></math>) controlling input scale,</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Stage depth</span> (<math id="A2.I1.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d_{i}\in\{2,3,4\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{i}\in\{2,3,4\}</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="A2.I1.i2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i=1</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="A2.I1.i2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>5</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">5</annotation></semantics></math> stages) determining active blocks per stage,</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Kernel size</span> (<math id="A2.I1.i3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k_{j}\in\{3,5,7\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k_{j}\in\{3,5,7\}</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="A2.I1.i3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j=1</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="A2.I1.i3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="20" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>20</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">20</annotation></semantics></math> convolutional layers),</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.I1.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Expansion ratio</span> (<math id="A2.I1.i4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="e_{j}\in\{3,4,6\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">e_{j}\in\{3,4,6\}</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="A2.I1.i4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j=1</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="A2.I1.i4.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="20" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>20</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">20</annotation></semantics></math> inverted residual blocks).</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
<p id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.2" class="ltx_p">The combinatorial space contains <math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sim" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>∼</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sim</annotation></semantics></math><math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="10^{19}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>19</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">10^{19}</annotation></semantics></math> architectures, with stage-specific depth controlling block activation patterns (<span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">e.g.,</span> <math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d=[2,3,4,3,2]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d=[2,3,4,3,2]</annotation></semantics></math> activates blocks 0-1,4-6,8-11,12-14,16-17).</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">ShuffleNet Search Space.</h5>

<div id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The ShuffleNet search space utilizes ShuffleNetv2 units and Xception modules as fundamental building blocks, featuring channel split/shuffle operations and depthwise separable convolutions. Configurable dimensions include:</p>
<ul id="A2.I2" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A2.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">ShuffleNet unit with <math id="A2.I2.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="3\times 3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">3\times 3</annotation></semantics></math> kernel,</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">ShuffleNet unit with <math id="A2.I2.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="5\times 5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">5\times 5</annotation></semantics></math> kernel,</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I2.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I2.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I2.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">ShuffleNet unit with <math id="A2.I2.i3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="7\times 7" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">7\times 7</annotation></semantics></math> kernel,</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I2.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I2.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I2.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Xception module.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
<p id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2" class="ltx_p">This yields <math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="4^{20}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>20</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">4^{20}</annotation></semantics></math> possible configurations, where each block’s operator is selected independently during sampling.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">AutoFormer Search Space.</h5>

<div id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The AutoFormer search space employs multi-head self-attention (MSA) and MLP blocks as fundamental units, defining a pure-transformer search space with four layer-wise variables:</p>
<ul id="A2.I3" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A2.I3.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I3.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I3.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.I3.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Depth</span>: Tiny <math id="A2.I3.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\in\{12,13,14\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\in\{12,13,14\}</annotation></semantics></math>, Small <math id="A2.I3.i1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\in\{12,13,14\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\in\{12,13,14\}</annotation></semantics></math>, and Base <math id="A2.I3.i1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\in\{14,15,16\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>14</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\in\{14,15,16\}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I3.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I3.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I3.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.I3.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Embedding dimension</span>: Tiny <math id="A2.I3.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\in\{192,216,240\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mn>192,216,240</mn><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\in\{192,216,240\}</annotation></semantics></math>, Small <math id="A2.I3.i2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\in\{320,384,448\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mn>320,384,448</mn><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\in\{320,384,448\}</annotation></semantics></math>, and Base <math id="A2.I3.i2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\in\{528,576,624\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mn>528,576,624</mn><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\in\{528,576,624\}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I3.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I3.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I3.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.I3.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Number of heads</span>: Tiny <math id="A2.I3.i3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\in\{3,4\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\in\{3,4\}</annotation></semantics></math>, Small <math id="A2.I3.i3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\in\{5,6,7\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\in\{5,6,7\}</annotation></semantics></math>, and Base <math id="A2.I3.i3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\in\{8,9,10\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\in\{8,9,10\}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I3.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I3.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I3.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.I3.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">MLP ratio</span> <math id="A2.I3.i4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\in\{3.0,3.5,4.0\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>3.0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3.5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4.0</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\in\{3.0,3.5,4.0\}</annotation></semantics></math> uniformly across all model scales.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
<p id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.2" class="ltx_p">The unified space exceeds <math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="10^{16}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>16</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">10^{16}</annotation></semantics></math> configurations with layer-wise independent hyperparameters.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Proof-of-Concept Experiment</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We provide the sampled architectures from our proof-of-concept experiment and their performance metrics on CIFAR-10 test set, along with the prompts provided to the LLM.</p>
</div>
<section id="A3.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.1 </span>Sampled Architectures</h3>

